<title>AUSTRIA: Austria issues 20 bln ats, 5-yr 4.625 pct bond.</title>
<headline>Austria issues 20 bln ats, 5-yr 4.625 pct bond.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria will issue a 20 billion schillings five-year bond with a 4.625 percent coupon and a maximum yield of 4.86 percent, the Kontrollbank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The bond, with an average yield of 4.602 percent, has an issue price of 100.10 percent. The bond will mature on May 23, 2002. -- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
